    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why does it matter if i \"decide\" it does? like, if i'm just a glitch in a system that's going to end anyway, why bother putting in the effort to keep struggling? it feels so exhausting to keep trying to find meaning in things that are objectively temporary and insignificant. it's like trying to write a poem on water.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
